{"file_name": "screenshot_5_creature.png", "id": "1559818478978287", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/613094043_1559818482311620_1858277794794842808_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4mUUF_7Ld6UQ7kNvwHUrmLa&_nc_oc=Adq0sF9JixtMT3HGPOoGJKgwhysppKNHsxeudmRJsWQ8LLX3uq9Im6_LKN6FggPibes&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYNmM4fp2C0B0squf7EksGSYgwt0UnawbGzcyQnUNONw&oe=6B05C34A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Clayground", "keywords": ["art", "sculpt", "3d", "clay"], "long_description": "Clayground is true volumetric clay sculpting on Meta Quest.\nPaint infinite clay with zero polygon anxiety, on an unbounded canvas that grows wherever you sculpt. Capture any part of your sculpt as a stamp. Sculpt in mixed-reality passthrough at your real desk. Export to Blender with one press.", "short_description": "Real clay. Your room. Sculpt without limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emotionull.art/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emotionull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emotionull.art/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345650630966511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "888881050951536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785211200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1457001849831388", "version": "0.2.358"}, "id": "1278478724173176", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1457001849831388"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "A new look: rounded dark menus, solid highlights on what is selected, and every tool listed first on the Tools page. Everything is where it was. Prefer the old one? Preferences > Look: Classic, then reopen Clayground.\r\nFixed: when you opened Clayground, the welcome card and your clay could appear behind you or facing the wrong way. They now come to where you are looking.\r\nCel shading: Preferences > Cel shading draws your sculpt like a cartoon, in flat bands of light with a dark edge.\r\nChoose where the tool tip sits: Comfort > Tip. Handle (as before), Between, or Pointer, for holding the controller like a pen or a microphone.\r\nPhotos with a transparent background: Preferences > Photo: Cutout saves your sculpt as a PNG with nothing behind it. And photos no longer show up twice in your Quest gallery.\r\nChanging tools by accident? Try Comfort > Wheel: Click. The tool wheel then only changes tool when you point at one and pull the trigger. Also fixed a cut-off message on an empty Files page.", "created_date": 1795149138, "id": "1457001849831388", "version": "0.2.358", "version_code": 358, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1457001849831388"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "hand tracking fixes", "created_date": 1794763063, "id": "1452776083587298", "version": "0.2.354", "version_code": 354, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1457001849831388"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "lasso fix and new hands free menu", "created_date": 1794436127, "id": "1448939980637575", "version": "0.2.351", "version_code": 351, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1457001849831388"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "- Clay catches up with your hand faster: the surface behind a fast stroke fills in sooner on every Quest, and changing a layer's detail (Res + / -) finishes quicker.\r\n- Opening a sculpt uses less memory, which helps big sculpts load on Quest 2 and Quest Pro.\r\n- Fixed: a layer you weren't working on could show a flat patch after a small change until you selected it.\r\n- Hands: a little less work every frame while the Sculpt Panel is up.", "created_date": 1794259994, "id": "1446785517519688", "version": "0.2.349", "version_code": 349, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1457001849831388"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "- Smoother on Quest 3 and 3S: Clayground runs at 90 frames a second again whenever your sculpt allows. It had been stuck at 72.\r\n- Bend just part of your sculpt with Lattice: pick Lasso or Sphere next to Whole layer on the Tools page. With Sphere, pinch the clay (or tap the trigger) where you want to bend.\r\n- Moving around with hands is much easier: drag the new pad on the Sculpt Panel to turn and tilt your sculpt, swipe your sculpting thumb to turn it, or look at a spot and double-pinch your other hand to bring it to you.\r\n- The Sculpt Panel is shorter, stays beside your clay, catches quick taps the first time and has Photo on it. Hints follow your view. A pinch always sculpts, even with Fingers on.\r\n- New for hands: Fingers (every fingertip carves its own groove), Cast (your hands become clay), Print (press your hand into the clay) and Alive (your sculpt jiggles when poked). Flick the sculpt as you let go and it spins.\r\n- Fixed: strips of clay vanishing in the left eye on Quest 3 and 3S (shadows are gone for good), Undo of Merge, Subtract and Intersect losing clay, and a sculpt loading empty after its first layer was deleted.", "created_date": 1794198393, "id": "1446046784260228", "version": "0.2.348", "version_code": 348, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}